{"id":1781232,"retrievedAt":"2026-09-27T15:59:33.218Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"https://www.mntnfilm.com/en/film/snow-flight-1937","id":1781232,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Snow Flight","overview":"The film was produced by Jerome Hill as 'a document of skiing according to the principles of Hannes Schneider.' It features Otto Lang, director of the Mt Rainier and Mt Baker ski schools. As the film opens, Otto emerges from a cabin beneath Table Mountain at the Mt Baker ski area with his canine friend. He applies wax-on climbing skins to his skis. Then he steps into his bindings and climbs to a scenic ridge. The narrator describes each technique in detail as Otto demonstrates again. Several of the maneuvers are done in slow motion on a slope meticulously packed by side-stepping.","popularity":0.0071,"poster_path":"/sgwZ7NAf5dS2dTj4ePJrB8iNWxm.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"US","name":"United States of America"}],"release_date":"1937-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":20,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"English","iso_639_1":"en","name":"English"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"A document of skiing according to the principles of Hannes Schneider","title":"Snow Flight","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[{"iso_3166_1":"US","title":"Vitaphone Varieties - Ski Flight","type":""}]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":126908,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Otto Lang","original_name":"Otto Lang","popularity":0.6658,"profile_path":null,"cast_id":1,"character":"Self","credit_id":"6ab84908ad1d2aeae30ed216","order":0}],"crew":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":1092235,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Jerome Hill","original_name":"Jerome Hill","popularity":0.8372,"profile_path":"/uIp1oFFRs7Lg